1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:03,812
I have a Master's and two Ph.Ds,
I should not have to do this.

2
00:00:04,183 --> 00:00:05,603
(Leonard:)What?

3
00:00:05,768 --> 00:00:08,108
I'm truly sorry
for what happened last night.

4
00:00:08,271 --> 00:00:10,101
(Sheldon:)I take full responsibility.

5
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:12,863
I hope that it won't color
your opinion of Leonard...

6
00:00:13,025 --> 00:00:19,115
(Sheldon:)...who is not only a wonderful guy,
but also, I hear, a gentle and thorough lover.

7
00:00:31,002 --> 00:00:33,132
(Sheldon:)I did what I could.

8
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,010
(Penny:)Hey, Raj.

9
00:00:43,723 --> 00:00:47,473
Hey, I don't know if you heard about
what happened with Leonard and Sheldon...

10
00:00:47,643 --> 00:00:49,313
(Penny:)...but I'm really upset about it.

11
00:00:49,478 --> 00:00:52,648
I mean, they let themselves into my place,
and then they cleaned it.

12
00:00:52,815 --> 00:00:55,605
(Penny:)Can you even believe that?
How weird is that?

13
00:00:55,776 --> 00:00:58,026
RAJESH [IN VOICE-OVER]:
She's standing very close to me.

